<title>MEXICO: Mexico IMSS jobs rise 67,116 in March - Zedillo.</title>
<headline>Mexico IMSS jobs rise 67,116 in March - Zedillo.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of permanently insured workers affiliated to the Mexican Institute for Social Security (IMSS) rose 67,116 in March, President Ernesto Zedillo said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;According to data given by the Mexican Institute for Social Security, in March there were 67,116 workers, reaching a total of more than 9.3 million permanent workers affiliated,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>He said this was the highest number of workers affiliated with the IMSS in the history of the institute.</p>
<p>((--Debora Montesinos, Mexico City newsroonm +525 7287915))</p>
</text>
